  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Performing arts MENA (DI) 2008-2012 - Performing arts MENA (DI)</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Scenkonst MENA (DI) 2008-2012</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektets l&#xe5;ngsiktiga m&#xe5;l &#xe4;r att st&#xf6;dja demokratisk utveckling genom att st&#xe4;rka yttrandefrihet i MENA. Detta implementeras genom           scenkonst, i synnerhet riktad mot barn och ungdomar. DIs roll &#xe4;r att  bidra med extern expertis och erfarenheter samt att vara den          regionala samordnaren. De nationella organisationerna utg&#xf6;r           tillsammans ett n&#xe4;tverk som verkar f&#xf6;r demokrati och yttrandefrihet.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The long-term objective is to help to develop freedom of speech and   trough that strengthening democracy and the respect for human rights  in the MENA. This is done by using performing arts particularly to    reach  children and youth. DI&apos;s role is to provide external inputs    and experiences and being the regional coordinator. The national org. consitute a regional network that works for these issues.</narrative>
  </description>
